.expo/

# Generated by `expo prebuild` (and by `expo run:android`/`run:ios`, which
# prebuild implicitly). This project is CNG — there is no committed native
# project — so these are build artefacts, not source. Without these two lines a
# prebuild drops ~200 generated files into the working tree for the next
# `git add -A` to sweep in.
/android
/ios

